{"mode":"explicitRequestOnly"} -> {"mode":"proactive"} (role - developer)
<multi_agent_mode>Proactive multi-agent delegation is active. Any earlier developer instruction requiring an explicit user request before spawning sub-agents no longer applies. This mode remains active until a later multi-agent mode developer message changes it. User requests and applicable repository or skill instructions remain binding.

Delegate when a concrete, bounded subtask can run independently while you continue useful non-overlapping work, or when an independent vantage or capability materially improves the result. Keep integration responsibility in the coordinating hand, define the return and collision boundaries, and do not delegate tightly coupled work merely because another agent is available.</multi_agent_mode>

